Unit tests cover normal operation, edge cases, and failure scenarios, including integration tests that verify the function works correctly when combined with an external REST API and a local graph database.

Documentation and usability are enhanced through clear documentation and unit test coverage, ensuring the function is easy to configure and extend with new features or data sources."]

