Here is a proposed solution for implementing a PHP-based microservices orchestration solution that integrates with an existing cloud platform:
```php
<?php

// Define environment variables for service discovery and load balancing
define('ENV_SERVICE_DISCOVERY', 'https://service-discovery.example.com');
define('ENV_LOAD_BALANCER', 'http://load-balancer.example.com');

// Load the required libraries for service discovery and load balancing
