The solution is designed to be highly scalable and fault-tolerant, with the ability to handle a large number of services deployed across multiple availability zones. The load balancer is implemented using a resilient algorithm that adapts to varying traffic patterns, ensuring that the services are always available to users. The service discovery mechanism uses a dynamic environment variables for service discovery, ensuring seamless integration with external services.

