* Logging using the SLF4J API for error logging and debugging purposes.

Note that this is just one possible implementation of the LineProcessor class, and you may need to modify it according to your specific requirements. Additionally, you will need to implement the readLogFileLines() method in order to read the log files and process each line separately.']

