We also define two additional functions `meetsCriteria` and `updateWebApp` to check if a transaction meets the specified criteria for triggering an alert and update the web application with the list of alerts, respectively. These functions are designed to be modular and reusable, allowing us to easily integrate them into other parts of the system or modify their behavior as needed.

